From: Eddie Chen <23001726+0x3ddie@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 03:01:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] rl-patches: worker instrumentation; logger-disable gate;
 staffmodlevel=4 non-prod; debugproc target=player+protected+forced; IFB/ARB
 debug logs

- World.ts: instrumentWorker() on login/friend/logger threads (surfaces real Bun worker errors)
- LoggerClient: connect() no-op when logger.enabled=false (fixes world crash: refused ws -> unhandled error -> worker terminated -> cycle postMessage throw)
- LoginThread: staffmodlevel 4 on non-production (chest commands for RL harness)
- ClientCheatHandler: debugprocs via executeScript(state, true, true) with target=player (chat-triggered procs need self as uid target or p_finduid guards abort)
- IfButtonHandler/PlayerOps: temporary ARB/IFB debug logs for dialog-resume tracing

Local-only (not committed): server/engine/.env NODE_TICKRATE=50
